  "created": "2026-10-25T21:05:43.433Z",
  "description": "Idiomatic, SWIG-like double-precision C# binding for the Bullet Physics Library (bullet3), compiled with USE_DOUBLE_PRECISION and closely following bullet3's own naming and conventions. Bundles native runtimes for win-x64, win-arm64, linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-x64 and osx-arm64.\n\nCovers collision shapes and algorithms, dynamics worlds and rigid bodies (including multithreaded variants), constraints, vehicle raycasting, the kinematic character controller, soft bodies and multibody dynamics, and .bullet world (de)serialization.\n\nDerivative of BulletSharpPInvoke/libbulletc, wrapping Bullet Physics Library (bullet3). Zlib licensed.",
