  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial public release.\n- Idiomatic double-precision C# binding, built against bullet3 3.25 (vendored as a submodule).\n- Restructured solution/project layout from the abandoned BulletSharpPInvoke base.\n- New: tools/verify_bindings, a binding-correctness checker across libbulletc, bullet3 and the C# API.\n- New: GitHub Actions CI building libbulletc from source and packaging native runtimes.\n- Numerous correctness fixes to the P/Invoke layer, including pre-existing bugs in upstream BulletSharpPInvoke, found via verify_bindings.\n- Native runtimes: win-x64, win-arm64, linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-x64, osx-arm64.",
